+- `LOCAL_NODE_EXECUTOR_MAX_OLD_SPACE_SIZE_MIB`;
+- `LOCAL_NODE_EXECUTOR_MAX_RSS_BYTES`;
+- `LOCAL_NODE_EXECUTOR_MAX_GENERATION_AGE_SECS`;
+- `LOCAL_NODE_EXECUTOR_MAX_IMPORTED_SOURCE_PACKAGES`.
